    },
    "390": {
      "date": "2026-11-15",
      "edition": "Sunday 15 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Captain's message",
          "heading": "Tuipulotu says Scotland are set on bouncing back from All Blacks defeat",
          "body": "Sione Tuipulotu, the Australia-born captain, says Scotland have confronted the footage of the 21-43 defeat to New Zealand and are determined to respond. \"That performance wasn't good enough. We know that and we want to put that right,\" he said. He says he will always have \"that little bit of fire\" when he plays Australia, whom he expects to arrive \"wounded\" after losing to England at Twickenham."
        },
        {
